The magnetic stripe is read by pulling it across a read head, either manually or automatically.

42
00:03:56,140 --> 00:04:01,180
After this, the read data can be used in the system without any human intervention.

43
00:04:01,510 --> 00:04:08,500
One of the properties of magnetic stripes are the strength of the magnetic field, necessary to modify

44
