45
00:04:10,930 --> 00:04:17,200
The magnetic stripe may have up to three tracks, as illustrated in the first picture.

46
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:23,710
Tracks one and two are specified to be read only tracks, while track 3rd May also be written to.

