of the magnetic stripe is intentionally not extended to the edges of the card, since the use of hand

49
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:43,060
operated card readers causes rapid wear at the ends of the stripe.

50
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:51,610
Although the storage capacity of the magnetic stripe is fairly small, around 1000 bits, it's more

51
00:04:51,610 --> 00:04:55,630
than sufficient for storing the information contained in the embossing.

52
