Typical applications for contactless memory cards are contactless ticketing in local transport systems

87
00:08:22,090 --> 00:08:26,920
and identification cards for companies, official bodies or universities.

88
00:08:27,580 --> 00:08:33,700
Electronic purse functionality, such as for company cafeteria or university cafeteria, for example,

89
00:08:33,700 --> 00:08:36,490
